sive agricultural plains.… [and] near a permanent water source. The pattern that emerges is of a series of medium and large-sized settlements near extensive areas suitable for agriculture… most fortified or at the very least with natural fortifications. In addition to these, there are a few small settlements [of less than 10 dunams area], mostly in fortified locations, with no small farms at all in the agricultural areas."<br>1. Capital (Jerusalem)2. Large and medium-sized settlements3. Small settlements'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2338, 'temperature': 0.2})
