al administrative centre Pikillacta (47ha) <br>Viracochapampa<br>Conchopata <br>3. Minor imperial administrative centreHonco Pampa<br>Huaro - 9ha <br>Batan Orqo<br>Cerro Baul - c.10 ha <br>Jincamocco - c. 15 ha <br>Azangaro<br>Wari Willka <br>4. VillageCuzco basin largest settlements 3-4 ha <br>5. HamletThese settlements would include sites of 1 ha and smaller, as seen in the Cuzco Valley. '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2649, 'temperature': 0.2})
