n trade operations from the port and collected taxes on any incoming business. The Periplus explains: \'the region (Rhapta) is under the rule of the governor of Mapharitis, since by some ancient right it became subject to the Kingdom of Arabia when it was first established. The merchants of Muza hold it through a grant from the king and collect taxes from it."<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2861, 'temperature': 0.2})
